  "caption": "Cantonese piano-house built for a Hong Kong club night where the crowd sings along in Cantonese. Classic early-90s house piano stabs in bright minor-seventh chords; a four-on-the-floor kick with open hi-hats on the off-beats; a rolling sub-octave house bassline; tambourine sixteenths; short string-pad swells into each chorus. Club-wide and bright, the piano forward, kick and bass locked tight, light hall reverb on the voice. Female mezzo, warm and loose, diva-house phrasing held straight without melisma, answered by a male backing voice. 124 BPM, F minor. Tipsy, giddy and broke, laughing at a two a.m. problem. No trap drums, no autotune, no dubstep or big-room drop, no disco string orchestra, no rap verse.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n一點四十 落到蘭桂坊條斜\n高踭鞋拎喺手 對腳仲識跳\n阿敏話尾班車 仲有一分鐘\n我哋跑到中環站 閘已經落咗\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我拍一拍八達通\n部機話我 得返三蚊\n\n[Chorus]\n得返三蚊 得返三蚊\n今晚跳到 銀包都跳埋\n得返三蚊 唔夠搭的士\n不如行過去 等綠van\n\n[Verse]\n皇后大道 冇車冇人\n我哋三個 喺斑馬線跳舞\n便利店入面 拍卡買咗支水\n一支水 三個人輪住飲\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n部機嘟一聲 我望一望\n個數話我 得返零蚊\n\n[Chorus]\n得返零蚊 得返零蚊\n阿敏話佢 有十蚊銀\n得返零蚊 都唔緊要\n綠van司機 收我哋硬幣\n\n[Bridge]\n坐喺最尾 窗外仲係黑\n阿敏瞓咗 個頭靠住我\n\n[Chorus]\n得返零蚊 得返零蚊\n聽朝增值 今晚唔理\n得返零蚊 首歌仲響緊\n成架綠van 跟住我哋唱\n\n[Outro]\n下個禮拜 再嚟過",
